s=\"vpi-social-github\"></span></a><!--]--></div><div class=\"VPFlyout VPNavBarExtra extra\" data-v-9fd4d1dd data-v-f953d92f data-v-bfe7971f><button type=\"button\" class=\"button\" aria-haspopup=\"true\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"extra navigation\" data-v-bfe7971f><span class=\"vpi-more-horizontal icon\" data-v-bfe7971f></span></button><div class=\"menu\" data-v-bfe7971f><div class=\"VPMenu\" data-v-bfe7971f data-v-20ed86d6><!----><!--[--><!--[--><!----><div class=\"group\" data-v-f953d92f><div class=\"item appearance\" data-v-f953d92f><p class=\"label\" data-v-f953d92f>Appearance</p><div class=\"appearance-action\" data-v-f953d92f><button class=\"VPSwitch VPSwitchAppearance\" type=\"button\" role=\"switch\" title aria-checked=\"false\" data-v-f953d92f data-v-be9742d9 data-v-b4ccac88><span class=\"check\" data-v-b4ccac88><span class=\"icon\" data-v-b4ccac88><!--[--><span class=\"vpi-sun sun\" data-v-be9742d9></span><span class=\"vpi-moon moon\" data-v-be9742d9></span><!--]--></span></span></button></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" data-v-f953d92f><div class=\"item social-links\" data-v-f953d92f><div class=\"VPSocialLinks social-links-list\" data-v-f953d92f data-v-e71e869c><!--[--><a class=\"VPSocialLink no-icon\" href=\"https://github.com/lipish/xtrace\" aria-label=\"github\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-v-e71e869c data-v-60a9a2d3><span class=\"vpi-social-github\"></span></a><!--]--></div></div></div><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--><button type=\"button\" class=\"VPNavBarHamburger hamburger\" aria-label=\"mobile navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"VPNavScreen\" data-v-9fd4d1dd data-v-6bee1efd><span class=\"container\" data-v-6bee1efd><span class=\"top\" data-v-6bee1efd></span><span class=\"middle\" data-v-6bee1efd></span><span class=\"bottom\" data-v-6bee1efd></span></span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"divider\" data-v-9fd4d1dd><div class=\"divider-line\" data-v-9fd4d1dd></div></div></div><!----></header><!----><!----><div class=\"VPContent is-home\" id=\"VPContent\" data-v-d8b57b2d data-v-9a6c75ad><div class=\"VPHome\" data-v-9a6c75ad data-v-e07eaea7><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"VPHero has-image VPHomeHero\" data-v-e07eaea7 data-v-dd8814ff><div class=\"container\" data-v-dd8814ff><div class=\"main\" data-v-dd8814ff><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><h1 class=\"heading\" data-v-dd8814ff><span class=\"name clip\" data-v-dd8814ff>xtrace</span><span class=\"text\" data-v-dd8814ff>AI Observability Service</span></h1><p class=\"tagline\" data-v-dd8814ff>Collect, store, and query traces, spans, and metrics across LLM and agent workflows. Built in Rust for speed and reliability.</p><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"actions\" data-v-dd8814ff><!--[--><div class=\"action\" data-v-dd8814ff><a class=\"VPButton medium brand\" href=\"/guide/getting-started\" data-v-dd8814ff data-v-93dc4167>Get Started \u2192</a></div><div class=\"action\" data-v-dd8814ff><a class=\"VPButton medium alt\" href=\"/integrations/xinference\" data-v-dd8814ff data-v-93dc4167>Xinference Integration \u2192</a></div><div class=\"action\" data-v-dd8814ff><a class=\"VPButton medium alt\" href=\"https://github.com/lipish/xtrace\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\" data-v-dd8814ff data-v-93dc4167>View on GitHub</a></div><!--]--></div><!--[--><!--]--></div><div class=\"image\" data-v-dd8814ff><div class=\"image-container\" data-v-dd8814ff><div class=\"image-bg\" data-v-dd8814ff></div><!--[--><!--[--><img class=\"VPImage image-src\" src=\"/logo.svg\" alt=\"xtrace\" data-v-ab19afbb><!--]--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"VPFeatures VPHomeFeatures\" data-v-e07eaea7 data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"container\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"items\" data-v-b1eea84a><!--[--><div class=\"grid-6 item\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-b1eea84a data-v-bd37d1a2><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-bd37d1a2><div class=\"icon\" data-v-bd37d1a2>\ud83d\udd2d</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Traces & Spans</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Full request-chain visibility with nested span trees. Debug P3 cycles (Plan \u2192 Execute \u2192 Reflect) and multi-step agent workflows.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-6 item\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-b1eea84a data-v-bd37d1a2><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-bd37d1a2><div class=\"icon\" data-v-bd37d1a2>\ud83d\udcca</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Time-Series Metrics</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Ingest and query GPU utilization, KV cache, token usage, and custom metrics with label-based filtering and downsampling.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-6 item\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-b1eea84a data-v-bd37d1a2><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-bd37d1a2><div class=\"icon\" data-v-bd37d1a2>\u26a1</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Built in Rust</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Axum + Tokio async runtime, batched ingestion via mpsc channels, PostgreSQL storage. Sub-millisecond overhead on the write path.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-6 item\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-b1eea84a data-v-bd37d1a2><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-bd37d1a2><div class=\"icon\" data-v-bd37d1a2>\ud83d\udd17</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-bd37d1a2>OpenTelemetry Compatible</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-bd37d1a2>OTLP/HTTP ingestion endpoint with JSON and Protobuf support. Drop-in replacement for Langfuse-compatible instrumentation.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-6 item\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-b1eea84a data-v-bd37d1a2><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-bd37d1a2><div class=\"icon\" data-v-bd37d1a2>\ud83c\udff7\ufe0f</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Multi-Dimensional Labels</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Attach session_id, model_name, agent_role, and arbitrary labels to metrics. Filter and group by any dimension.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><div class=\"grid-6 item\" data-v-b1eea84a><div class=\"VPLink no-icon VPFeature\" data-v-b1eea84a data-v-bd37d1a2><!--[--><article class=\"box\" data-v-bd37d1a2><div class=\"icon\" data-v-bd37d1a2>\ud83d\udcc8</div><h2 class=\"title\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Percentile Analytics</h2><p class=\"details\" data-v-bd37d1a2>Query p50/p90/p99 latency distributions. Compare performance across versions, models, and agent configurations.</p><!----></article><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"vp-doc container\" style=\"\" data-v-e07eaea7 data-v-c141a4bd><!--[--><div style=\"position:relative;\" data-v-e07eaea7><div><div class=\"changelog-section\"><h2 id=\"what-s-new\" tabindex=\"-1\">What&#39;s New <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#what-s-new\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;What&#39;s New&quot;\">\u200b</a></h2><div class=\"changelog-list\"><div class=\"changelog-item\"><span class=\"changelog-version\">v0.1.0</span><span class=\"changelog-date\">Apr 2026</span><div class=\"changelog-content\"><strong>Xinference Compatibility Hardening</strong> \u2014 Added Python compat and integration guidance for replacing Langfuse with xtrace, deployment examples for GCP and systemd, smoke / end-to-end validation scripts, and improved batch ingest compatibility for <code>sessionId</code>-style clients. <div class=\"changelog-links\"><a href=\"/integrations/langfuse\">Integration Guide \u2192</a><a href=\"/sdk/rust-client\">SDK Docs \u2192</a></div></div></div><div class=\"changelog-item\"><span class=\"changelog-version\">v0.0.13</span><span class=\"changelog-date\">Feb 2026</span><div class=\"changelog-content\"><strong>Percentile Aggregation &amp; group_by</strong> \u2014 Metrics query now supports <code>agg=p50|p90|p99</code> via PostgreSQL <code>percentile_cont</code>, and <code>group_by</code> to split time-series by any label key. Frontend dashboard with trace list and detail viewer. <div class=\"changelog-links\"><a href=\"/api/metrics-api\">Metrics API \u2192</a></div></div></div><div class=\"changelog-item\"><span class=\"changelog-version\">v0.0.11</span><span class=\"changelog-date\">Jan 2026</span><div class=\"changelog-content\"><strong>Per-Token Rate Limiting</strong> \u2014 Per-bearer-token query rate limiting using the governor crate (token bucket). Configurable via <code>RATE_LIMIT_QPS</code> and <code>RATE_LIMIT_BURST</code>. Returns <code>429 Too Many Requests</code> with a <code>Retry-After</code> header. </div></div><div class=\"changelog-item\"><span class=\"changelog-version\">v0.0.8</span><span class=\"changelog-date\">Jan 2026</span><div class=\"changelog-content\"><strong>Nebula Signal Contract</strong> \u2014 Formalized metrics signal contract for Nebula (GPU cluster) integration. Node reports GPU/KV-cache/queue metrics; Router reads real-time signals for load-aware routing; Scheduler reads for placement decisions. <div class=\"changelog-links\"><a href=\"/integrations/nebula\">Nebula Docs \u2192</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--]--></div></div></div><footer class=\"VPFooter\" data-v-d8b57b2d data-v-566314d4><div class=\"container\" data-v-566314d4><p class=\"message\" data-v-566314d4>Released under the MIT License.</p><p class=\"copyright\" data-v-566314d4>\u00a9 2025-present xtrace contributors</p></div></footer><!--[--><!--]--></div></div>\n    <script>window.__VP_HASH_MAP__=JSON.parse(\"{\\\"api_metrics-api.md\\\":\\\"oRnYw5kT\\\",\\\"api_otlp.md\\\":\\\"Vm21EVVa\\\",\\\"api_rest-api.md\\\":\\\"7SNv2Mze\\\",\\\"guide_configuration.md\\\":\\\"DthLePug\\\",\\\"guide_deployment.md\\\":\\\"h5K7zsaK\\\",\\\"guide_development.md\\\":\\\"BxQAKzKe\\\",\\\"guide_getting-started.md\\\":\\\"Bv1As6US\\\",\\\"guide_session-ingest.md\\\":\\\"gxbGidoB\\\",\\\"index.md\\\":\\\"CHODyLS9\\\",\\\"integrations_langfuse.md\\\":\\\"DMmQaTxY\\\",\\\"integrations_nebula.md\\\":\\\"a54Dsr0j\\\",\\\"integrations_tracing.md\\\":\\\"BNW0-VEf\\\",\\\"integrations_xinference.md\\\":\\\"BDb_jcLf\\\",\\\"sdk_python-sdk.md\\\":\\\"n1U__PHH\\\",\\\"sdk_rust-client.md\\\":\\\"cu5RHpcG\\\"}\");window.__VP_SITE_DATA__=JSON.parse(\"{\\\"lang\\\":\\\"en-US\\\",\\\"dir\\\":\\\"ltr\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"xtrace\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"AI Observability \u2014 Traces, Metrics & Spans for LLM and Agent Workflows\\\",\\\"base\\\":\\\"/\\\",\\\"head\\\":[],\\\"router\\\":{\\\"prefetchLinks\\\":true},\\\"appearance\\\":true,\\\"themeConfig\\\":{\\\"logo\\\":\\\"/logo.svg\\\",\\\"siteTitle\\\":\\\"xtrace\\\",\\\"nav\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Guide\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/guide/getting-started\\\",\\\"activeMatch\\\":\\\"/guide/\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"API\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/api/rest-api\\\",\\\"activeMatch\\\":\\\"/api/\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"SDK\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/sdk/rust-client\\\",\\\"activeMatch\\\":\\\"/sdk/\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Integrations\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/integrations/nebula\\\",\\\"activeMatch\\\":\\\"/integrations/\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"v0.0.16\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Changelog\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://github.com/lipish/xtrace/releases\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"crates.io\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"https://crates.io/crates/xtrace\\\"}]}],\\\"sidebar\\\":{\\\"/guide/\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Introduction\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Getting Started\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/guide/getting-started\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Configuration\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/guide/configuration\\\"}]},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Advanced\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Development\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/guide/development\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Deployment\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/guide/deployment\\\"},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Session-Aware Ingest\\\",\\\"link\\\":\\\"/guide/session-ingest\\\"}]}],\\\"/api/\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"API Reference\\\",\\\"items\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"REST API\\\",\\\"l